CodeQL (no PR); the runner on CI (the live set is not in `ci.yml`); the full `npm run test:e2e` suite and the five CI shards (CI's; only `--check-shards` and `--shard nosuch` are run); the order check as a CI job; Windows and Linux (macOS only); the hosted UAT, demo and production sites (no HTTP to them); the SQL Server shard; any browser other than the project's Chromium; a showcase-OFF API started on an old showcase database (the disclosed limit of the mode read, unless you probe it); `az`.
